			"id": "eiMqhL-2lWIqnY7X2",
			"description": "Inferno Pistol",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A pistol-format melta weapon carried by Astartes command squads, Inquisitors and Tempestus officers wanting a point-blank answer to armour without a full meltagun's bulk; background consistently frames it as devastating at arm's length and near-useless at any real distance.\n\nDesign: Scaled down two dice from the meltagun anchor (8dx6(10) burn) to 6dx6(10) burn for a pistol- sized fuel cell, on a very short 5/25 range band matching the anchor's \"vehicle-killer at short range, much less beyond\" description. At short range 6dx6 averages 126, which - like the full meltagun - penetrates every vehicle on the AV table and any personal armour outright (effective DR under the (10) divisor never exceeds 35, even against AV14's DR 350). See the Meltagun entry for the beyond-½D check; the pistol's beyond-½D line is one die lower than the meltagun's (3d vs 4d), the same one-die-down relationship as the old scale.",
