		{
			"id": "e64ziIFBU5EcDC7Nz",
			"description": "Multi-Melta",
			"local_notes": "Lore: A tripod- or vehicle-mounted heavy melta weapon fielded by heavy weapon teams and as a common tank sponson/hull weapon; background treats it exactly as a bigger meltagun, killing the heaviest vehicles at short range and rapidly losing effect beyond it.\n\nDesign: Two dice over the meltagun anchor (10dx6(10) vs 8dx6(10) short, 5dx6(3) vs 4dx6(3) beyond), matching this project's standard heavy-weapon progression, on a slightly longer 15/75 range band appropriate to a crew-served weapon with a bigger reactor. At short range it averages 210 and penetrates every vehicle and personal armour on the tables without exception, same as the meltagun; beyond ½D the extra die keeps it meaningfully ahead of the meltagun against the heaviest tanks (31% vs AV14, versus the meltagun's 5%) while still tailing off, matching the fiction's \"bigger meltagun\" framing rather than a full return to short-range lethality. ST 13 and Gunner (Beams) reflect a support weapon needing a mount or a very strong user rather than a shoulder-fired arm.",
