					"usage_notes": "Half the dice past ½D (the usual GURPS rule) and the armour divisor falls from (10) to (3) as the fusion beam loses cohesion. Unlike the shoulder-fired meltagun, this still wrecks AV13 (avg 105 vs DR 275/3 = eff. 91, 70%) and has a real chance against AV14 (31%), reflecting the bigger reactor's reserve of power.\n",
